Stamping is idempotent: an artifact already carrying `metrics_*` keys is reported as skipped with
`written` false and no numbers at all — the transcript is never even read. The seeded values are
deliberately nothing like what the seeded transcript would produce (one turn, 12:00:00 → 12:09:00 =
540s = 9 minutes, input 42 / output 8), so dropping the guard would change both stdout and the file;
the `expected/` section below is byte-identical to the fixture above it.

-- fixtures/home/.claude/projects/proj/s-echo.jsonl --
{"type":"user","isSidechain":false,"origin":{"kind":"human"},"timestamp":"2026-08-01T12:00:00.000Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"go"}}
{"type":"assistant","isSidechain":false,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T12:09:00.000Z","message":{"role":"assistant","model":"claude-fx-sonnet","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ok"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":42,"output_tokens":8}}}
-- fixtures/cwd/plan/index.md --
---
title: Echo plan
sessions:
- s-echo
metrics_active_minutes: 1
metrics_models:
- claude-fx-ancient
metrics_tokens_input: 2
metrics_tokens_output: 3
metrics_tokens_cache_creation: 4
metrics_tokens_cache_read: 5
---

Body.
